{"title":"좀먹은 사이키델리즘","artist":"짓푸스","sourceId":"reference:woux3p5FShJ9qZ3IGIxw","sourceHash":"df9c537f32825b2afd938ac089659ad932cbcb10adbcf68adb2e4d1c034ccf19","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":28.58,"end":31.58,"text":"物心ついた贖罪と 当たり前で乱れた光景","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":37.54,"end":40.54,"text":"平和なんてエゴでしかなくて 隠してた袖を振り下ろした","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":46.79,"end":49.79,"text":"飢えた マナで 未来像 見ても","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":51.23,"end":54.23,"text":"さらば 言触れの式よ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":55.28,"end":58.28,"text":"君を殺して 壊して ぐしゃぐしゃにして","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":59.71,"end":62.71,"text":"折れた針で 眼を貫いて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":64.46,"end":67.46,"text":"心閉ざして 忘れられたとしても","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":69.25,"end":72.25,"text":"僕は 独りでに叫んだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":74.16,"end":77.16,"text":"仕組まれた階段に埋もれ 穴だらけ 賽の欠片","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":83.22,"end":86.22,"text":"愛情なんて理解できなくて 焦らしてた襟を切り離した","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":92.45,"end":95.45,"text":"媚びた 意図で 世迷言 見ても","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":96.83,"end":99.83,"text":"さらば 虫食いの意味よ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":100.92,"end":103.92,"text":"君を犯して 喘かせて キズモノにして","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":105.44,"end":108.44,"text":"化けた欲を 眼に焼き付けて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":110.1,"end":113.1,"text":"心開いて 思い出せるものなら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":114.8,"end":117.8,"text":"僕は 控えめに吼えた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":138.01,"end":141.01,"text":"吐いた ベッドで もがいた 君を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":142.52,"end":145.52,"text":"そっと 横目で流した","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":147.03,"end":150.03,"text":"老いて 惹いて 巻き戻しして","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":151.19,"end":154.19,"text":"死期を悟った ゴメンネ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":154.78,"end":157.78,"text":"僕を 殺して 壊して バラバラにして","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":159.07,"end":162.07,"text":"最後の手は 容を変えて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":163.65,"end":166.65,"text":"涙零れて 愛も砂漠と化して","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":168.6,"end":171.6,"text":"君は 手遅れに消えた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}